title WF01 Generate research report (a) - request and retrieval
|User|
start
:Enter research question,\nyear range, scope or papers;
:Preview evidence papers\n(optional);
:Choose report type and\nsubmit;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Enough credits and under\nthe pending limit?) then ([no])
  :Reject request;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Charge credits and\nqueue the report;
:Retrieve evidence papers\nfrom the corpus;
|External AI provider|
:Embed question;
|LumiGap platform|
if (Evidence found?) then ([no])
  :Mark failed and\nrefund credits;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:Generate the report;
stop
